ALWIDA AYE FATIMA ZEHRA KE DILBAR ALWIDA <br>
<br>
ALWIDA TASHNA DAHEN AYE SHEH KI DUKHTAR ALWIDA,<br>
 ALWIDA MASOOM ASGHAR JAANE MAADAR ALWIDA,<br>
 ALWIDA EK SHAB KI DULHAN KE MUQADDAR ALWIDA,<br>
 CHHOD KAR HUM KO CHALE JAATE HAI SARWAR ALWIDA<br>
<br>
TAZIYA KHAANE HUE SUNSAAN AYE AHLE AZA,<br>
 AHL-BAIT-E MUSTAFA AB HOTE HAIN HUM SE JUDA,<br>
 AB NA HOGA GIRYA-O-MATAM NA WO AH-O-BUKA,<br>
 JAA RAHE HAIN HIND SE KARBAL KO SARWAR ALWIDA<br>
<br>
TERE GHAM MEIN MAUT AAJATI YE HASRAT RAHGAYI,<br>
 KARNA PAYE HAQ ADA KUCH AYE HUSSAIN IBNE ALI,<br>
 HAIN LIYE AANKHON MEIN ASHK-E-GHAM KA NAZRANA SABHI,<br>
 LIJIYE PURSA HAMARA SHEH KI QAWHAR ALWIDA<br>
<br>
AATI THI RUMAAL LEKAR MAJLISON MEIN FATIMA,<br>
 LETI THI AANSOO BARAE BAQSHISHE AHL-E-AZA,<br>
 DETI JATI THI DUWAEN RONEWALON KO SADA,<br>
 AB WO JAATI HAIN LIYE APNA BHARA GHAR ALWIDA<br>
<br>
GAR BACHE AGLE BARAS KAR PAYENGE MATAM TERA,<br>
 WARNA MARQAD MEIN KARENGE GIRYA-O-AAH-O- BUKA,<br>
 HAI TAMANNA GHAM MEIN SHEH KE AANKH HO PURNAM SADA,<br>
 ALWIDA AYE QHAFELA SALAARE LASHKAR ALWIDA,<br>
<br>
AYE ALAMDAR-E-HUSSAIN IBNE ALI TUM PAR SALAAM, 
<br>QASIM-O-AUN-O-MOHAMMED NAAZISHEY HYDER SALAAM,<br>
 HUM SHABEEH-E-MUSTAFA TASVEERE PAIGHAMBAR SALAAM,<br>
 ALWIDA ZAINAB KI JAAN LAILA KE DILBAR ALWIDA,<br>
<br>
UMR BHAR KARTE RAHENGE SHEH KA MATAM HUM SOHAIL,<br>
 KARBALA-E-GHAM HAI DIL REHTA HAI DIL MEIN GHAM SOHAIL,<br>
 HAQ ADA HO JAYE EHSAAN KA HAI KIS MEIN DAM HAI SOHAIL,<br>
 QHALBE SHARMINDA SE AB KEHTE HAIN ROKAR ALWIDA..